{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:20:08.307Z","ordinal":422,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a19ecc-82f0-7492-9f12-a328e4f8c843","turn_id":"01a1a45b-31ee-7241-935c-a26e910b3db7","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_080347deb607e55e016aea965454f4819b9463c4ae8f1c59e0","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Yes. I’d make the defaults match Git:\n\n- **`sun push`** uploads history and advances the remote pointer. If histories diverged, it rejects and asks you to pull.\n- **`sun pull`** fetches and joins histories locally. You can inspect the result before pushing.\n- **`git push`** also attempts `sun push`, without silently joining either history.\n\nOne difference should stay explicit: Sun joins recorded histories while preserving the local file snapshot. Git handles file merges.\n\nThat would replace the current behavior where `sun push` automatically joins histories."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793758804377,"completed_at_ms":1793758808307}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:20:08.309Z","ordinal":423,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_080347deb607e55e016aea965454f4819b9463c4ae8f1c59e0","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Yes. I’d make the defaults match Git:\n\n- **`sun push`** uploads history and advances the remote pointer. If histories diverged, it rejects and asks you to pull.\n- **`sun pull`** fetches and joins histories locally. You can inspect the result before pushing.\n- **`git push`** also attempts `sun push`, without silently joining either history.\n\nOne difference should stay explicit: Sun joins recorded histories while preserving the local file snapshot. Git handles file merges.\n\nThat would replace the current behavior where `sun push` automatically joins histories.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a45b-31ee-7241-935c-a26e910b3db7","create_time":1793758804.4221256,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_080347deb607e55e016aea965454f4819b9463c4ae8f1c59e0","turn_id":"01a1a45b-31ee-7241-935c-a26e910b3db7","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1a45b-48f5-7550-a71a-9a8524b386c5","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":43}}
